# The build context is the repository root (compose.yaml), so the .dockerignore beside this file is
# never read. BuildKit uses this one instead. Keeps the database, install key and .env files out of
# the build cache, and keeps the context small.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.gradle
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
docker-container/data
.ci-data
android
windows-companion
local-helper
music-player
docs
now-playing.html
now-playing-header.html
*.md
!**/README.md
